    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">4.1 # of countries supported on gender responsive national and sub-national (not local) multi-hazard EWS 
4.2 # of gender responsive contingency and preparedness plans, standard operational procedures supported 
4.3 # of officials (disaggregated by sex and organization/institution type) trained in early warning system and preparedness showing increased knowledge in the subject
4.4 # of digital solutions in early warning and early action enabling effective preparedness piloted/ scaled up 
4.5 - Knowledge management and/ or development products for preparedness developed and expanded for access of national and local institutions and stakeholders</narrative>
    </description>
